rkisp2: Find the CSI-2 receiver and VICAP interface from the sensor

Instead of hard-coding the CSI-2 receiver at 0xfdd30000 and rkcif-mipi2,
find the capture device closest to the sensor as the simple pipeline handler
does, and use MediaPipeline, as the rkisp1 pipeline handler does, to find
the CSI-2 receiver and VICAP MIPI interface on the way to it. This makes
cameras on the other CSI-2 ports, such as the Orange Pi 5's CAM2 and CAM3
through the DC-PHYs, work.

